nd his IBM Fellowship arguably does as well. (The redlinked fellowships and awards, not so much.) He also has highly-cited publications as listed in a Google scholar search, easily enough for #C1, which the nominator does not even seem to have considered or read. The nomination rationale that his position is not senior is both irrelevant and false — he appears to hold a somewhat high-level position within the type of employement he holds, as a researcher at an industrial lab [[User:David]] 23:41, 18 May 2020 (UTC)",
